  ],
  "must_be_indexed": [
   "REQUIRED_RESEARCH_MODULE",
   "SUPPORT_MODULE"
  ],
  "note": "REQUIRED vs SUPPORT expresses research salience, not coverage: BOTH must be indexed. Any physical module absent from this registry is UNKNOWN and fails the build until classified. To exclude a module, set its category to GENERATED_OR_EXCLUDED and give a 'reason'; an empty reason is itself an error.",
